# idioms.tbl — verb idioms as surface patterns
#   kind | pattern | japanese | class | particle
#   pattern: English lemma + fixed words, with slots  NP (a noun phrase the parser builds)  SELF (a reflexive pronoun)
#   kind:  phrasal     verb + particle, no object            get on       -> 乗る
#          phrasal+np  verb + preposition, then the object   look for NP  -> 探す   (the preposition is part of the verb)
#          after       the particle follows the object       put NP on    -> 着る
#          idiom       fixed words, then the object          get in touch with NP -> 連絡を取る, particle と on the NP
#          tail        the object, then fixed words          take NP into account -> 考慮に入れる
#   class: g i s k (verb) · aru (noun + ある) · fixed (already finite)       particle: what the object takes (idiom, tail)

